    "Overall, the forecast assigns a modest probability to a 2/3 majority, but with substantial uncertainty; the calibrated range centers near 0.50."
  ],
  "confidence": "low",
  "narrative": "Anchored on the historical frequency of 2/3 majorities, the forecast updates with mixed polls, potential opposition unity, and fragmentation risks. The balance of forces suggests a plausible but uncertain path to a 2/3 majority, yielding an intermediary probability around 0.50 with a wide uncertainty band.",
  "justification": {
    "anchor": {
      "probability": 0.56,
      "basis": "Two-thirds majority outcomes in Hungarian parliamentary elections since 1990; five of nine elections achieved 2/3, indicating a non-negligible historical baseline."
